# Model Inference Rules

## Latency budget
Total budget: 500ms candle-close to signal emission
- DB context fetch: < 20ms
- DQG: < 10ms
- GPU inference (batch 10): < 200ms
- Post-process: < 10ms
- Redis publish: < 5ms

## Prediction validation
After each prediction, enforce OHLCV invariants and non-negative volume.
If constraints fail: log, clip to enforce validity, and flag metadata.
Never return NaN predictions; raise PredictionError.

## Model hot-swap
KronosEngine must support live model reload via _load_model() under lock,
ensuring old references are only released after full load.

## Sampling
Default sample_count=10 and temperature=0.7 must remain config-driven.
Never hardcode sampling parameters in inference code.
